{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Company of Heroes 3: Endure &amp; Defy is a Battlegroup DLC pack consisting of four Battlegroups for Multiplayer and Co-Op/ skirmish vs AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>US Forces \u2013 Italian Partisan Battlegroup</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deploy daring Partisans to wreak havoc behind the lines. Cunning, deception, and sabotage are how your forces will prevail.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave Resistance Fighters and Saboteurs will enhance your ground forces, while tunnel networks, resource siphoning, and underground detonations will cause the enemy to collapse from within.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095900/extras/3b583a582459a492fe38c2b5f4bdea51.avif?t=1762455671\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095900/extras_big/3b583a582459a492fe38c2b5f4bdea51.avif?t=1762455671 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wehrmacht \u2013 Last Stand Battlegroup</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Victory requires sacrifice. Bolster your line with powerful improvised defenses and embolden your ground forces with a number of extraordinary measures.</i> \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repel the Allied advance with the imposing Pantherturm and immobilized vehicles, then demoralize their troops with the Propaganda Tower. Panzerfaust rollouts, improvised barrages, and final battle directives enable victory at any cost. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095900/extras/75e2ec84d1197df821d11ae16dbbe3d4.avif?t=1762455671\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095900/extras_big/75e2ec84d1197df821d11ae16dbbe3d4.avif?t=1762455671 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>British Forces \u2013 Polish Cavalry Battlegroup</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seek revenge with grizzled Polish troops who long for battle, and smash the enemy with devastating heavy weaponry.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite Polish Lancer Sections lead the line, while Polish-crewed Sherman Fireflies and Land Mattresses demolish enemy positions and armor with frightening efficiency. All Polish units thrive against veteran enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095900/extras/fd142db9dacd2f4d6779916adeb95c0c.avif?t=1762455671\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095900/extras_big/fd142db9dacd2f4d6779916adeb95c0c.avif?t=1762455671 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deutsches Afrikakorps \u2013 Kriegsmarine Battlegroup</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bring the might of the German Navy to bear. Fortify your positions, establish vital supply chains, and then annihilate all in your path with catastrophic fire support.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kriegsmarine infantry provide combat flexibility and engineering prowess. Establish Hardpoints to secure territory and enable supply drops. Stuka Bombers, Fritz Glide-bombs, and Naval salvos will break the enemy upon your shores.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095900/extras/cfa78ada241b414dd160894695e7d9ce.avif?t=1762455671\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095900/extras_big/cfa78ada241b414dd160894695e7d9ce.avif?t=1762455671 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4095900?t=1762455671","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4095900?t=1762455671","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095900/eb581d9d0d63bfaa6fb4cbfda1992e6c86c82da2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762455671","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095900/eb581d9d0d63bfaa6fb4cbfda1992e6c86c82da2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762455671","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Features realistic top-down depictions of WW2 warfare. Violence is frequent and detailed."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Company of Heroes 3: Endure &amp; Defy is a Battlegroup DLC pack consisting of four Battlegroups for Multiplayer and Co-Op/ skirmish vs AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>US Forces \u2013 Italian Partisan Battlegroup</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deploy daring Partisans to wreak havoc behind the lines. Cunning, deception, and sabotage are how your forces will prevail.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave Resistance Fighters and Saboteurs will enhance your ground forces, while tunnel networks, resource siphoning, and underground detonations will cause the enemy to collapse from within.\u00a0</p><p clas